==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Rose Garden Witch]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**12 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns.

